{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_71","type":"agent_message","text":"The main functional issue is confirmed: after the terminal UI selects the Work Leaf command row, `TerminalAppCore` delegates `/status` to the controller, and the controller still routes it to the last controller-selected agent. That violates the “selected backend agent” condition because the UI has no selected agent in that state."}}
