{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_76","type":"agent_message","text":"FINDINGS\n\n- `src/terminal_app.rs:629-635`: if the UI has no selected agent, slash prompts fall through to `controller.execute_command_line`; but `src/workspace.rs:132-138` still uses the controller’s stale `selected_agent`. Repro: create an agent, move selection to the `work-leaf command` row, then enter `:/status`. The UI has no selected backend agent, but `/status` is still sent to the previous agent.\n\n- Missing required real-agent verification for this agent-facing slash send/resume change. `AGENTS.md:100-107` requires a real configured backend scenario or exact pre-agent blocker; the diff/commit only shows fake backend and deterministic fake Codex coverage."}}
